&lt;p&gt;ANY POWER HYDRAULIC INDUSTRY took part in TIMTOS 2019, a significant event for the machine tool industry. The exhibition was held from March 4th to 9th, 2019, at the Taipei Nangang Exhibition Center, Hall 2. Our booth was located at R1330. For more details about the event, visit the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.timtos.com.tw/en/index.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;official TIMTOS website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
